<title>FRANCE: Total buys Argon of Argentina.</title>
<headline>Total buys Argon of Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French oil group Total SA said on Monday it had signed an agreement to buy the entire capital of Argentina's Argon, the country's biggest LPG distributor with a 25 percent market share.</p>
<p>Total gave no financial information on the deal.</p>
<p>Argon distributes more than 200,000 tonnes of liquified petroleum gas per year. The deal is subject to a number of conditions which are expected to be lifted in the coming months, it said.</p>
</text>
